# ==============================================================================
# Docker Build Context Filter
# ==============================================================================
# Only send files the Dockerfile actually needs. Without this, every file
# change in persistent-sandbox/ (Claude logs, config.json, README, etc.)
# gets sent as build context and can invalidate Docker cache layers.
# ==============================================================================

# Exclude everything by default
*

# Include only what the Dockerfile actually COPYs
!.devcontainer/Dockerfile
!.devcontainer/environments/*.yml
